" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_0.png\" /></td><td><img id=\"idt83\" onclick=\"htImageZoom('idt83', '0%')\" alt=\"Numeral maia 0\" src=\"images/HistoryTracers/Maya_0.png\" /></td></tr> </table> </p>",
               "source": null,
